  "authority": "layer-terrain-regime-atlas",
  "purpose": "Classify the Potato House's major structures by what kind of thing they are—whole, coordinate, standing plane, terrain, regime, organism, material state, threshold, perceptual layer, process or route—so symbols can be populated without being flattened into one vertical hierarchy.",
